  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "A unit with Curse of the Wulfen gets its OC bonus only while free of Battle-shock and within either of two ranges. The supporting model must be friendly. A Wolf Priest counts at up to 12″. A Space Wolves Character that lacks Wulfen counts at up to 6″. Give Infantry models in the unit +1 OC and Vehicle models +3 OC. Each Wulfen model occupies two places when counting transport capacity.",
